        "original_id": "b3aae393-8826-5769-aa93-ab1780158add",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liz Rose, Taylor Swift, Pat McLaughlin, Gary Allan\n- Songs: \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" \"You Belong with Me,\" \"Songs About Rain\"\n- Companies: Big Machine Records\n- Albums: Taylor Swift's eponymous debut album\n- Awards: Grammy Award\n\nFacts:\n- \"Songs About Rain\" is a song written by Pat McLaughlin and Liz Rose and recorded by American country music artist Gary Allan.\n- \"Teardrops on My Guitar\" was released on February 19, 2007, by Big Machine Records as the second single from Taylor Swift's eponymous 2006 debut album.\n- Liz Rose has co-written twenty of Taylor Swift's officially released songs and singles, including \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" and \"You Belong with Me.\"\n- Liz Rose and Taylor Swift won a Grammy Award in 2010 for \"You Belong with Me.\"",
